      "weather": "FINE",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MALICIOUS (2) looks close to another win after finishing third from Box 4 last time (30.60) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Rates highly and will give a great sight. HEY ARNOLD (1) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at Wentworth Park over 520m behind POUND KEEPING (30.07) in a Grade 5. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Has ability and can atone. POUND KEEPING (4) is an honest type who is having her first try here. Comes into this after an impressive win last time scoring by 5.5 lengths at Wentworth Park (29.35). Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Bold showing expected again. LARRIKIN PIONEER (3) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Will give a great sight.",
